:: DreamRouter {"position":"2050,975","size":"100,100"}
<<set $timeOfDay = "night">>
<<set $currentMode = "sleep">>
<<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
<<set $traceFirstDream = true>>
<<set $returnEventPending = true>>
<<if $dreamCordUnlocked and not $dreamCordSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Cord">>
<<elseif $dreamNoNameUnlocked and not $dreamNoNameSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_NoName">>
<<elseif $dreamNoSwordUnlocked and not $dreamNoSwordSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_NoSword">>
<<elseif not $dreamNoSwordSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_NoSword">>
<<elseif $danger >= 12 and not $dangerTrapDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Danger_Trap">>
<<elseif $danger >= 12 and not $dangerDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Danger_Hands">>
<<elseif $danger >= 12 and $dangerDreamSeen and not $forgottenNightmareSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Danger_ForgottenNightmare">>
<<elseif $isolation >= 16 and not $isolationChildBattlefieldDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Isolation_ChildBattlefield">>
<<elseif $isolation >= 12 and not $isolationDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Isolation_Fog">>
<<elseif $hanbeiLove >= 6 and not $hanbeiDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Hanbei">>
<<elseif $kuroLove >= 6 and not $kuroDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Kuro">>
<<elseif $genichiroLove >= 6 and not $genichiroDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Genichiro">>
<<elseif $sculptorLove >= 6 and not $sculptorDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Sculptor">>
<<elseif $isshinLove >= 6 and not $isshinDreamSeen>>
  <<goto "Dream_Isshin">>
<<else>>
  <<goto "Dream_DefaultSleep">>
<</if>>

:: Dream_Router {"position":"2050,925","size":"100,100"}
<<goto "DreamRouter">>

:: Dream_NoSword {"position":"2425,700","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $dreamNoSwordSeen = true>>
<<set $traceFirstDream = true>>
<<set $recordBookNewDream = true>>
<<set $lastDream = "no_sword">>

<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">늑대는 꿈을 꾸었다.

손이 비어 있었다.

하지만 손가락은,
무언가를 쥔 모양으로 굳어 있었다.

검이 없는데도
검의 무게가 남아 있었다.</div>
</div>

<<recordNotice "dream">>

<<continueTo "AdvanceDay">>
<</page>>

:: Dream_Cord {"position":"2425,825","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $dreamCordSeen = true>>
<<set $traceFirstDream = true>>
<<set $recordBookNewDream = true>>
<<set $lastDream = "cord">>

<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">늑대는 물속에 서 있었다.

발목에 무언가가 감겨 있었다.

끈인지,
손인지,
풀인지 알 수 없었다.

움직이면 더 깊이 조였다.
가만히 있으면 더 아래로 가라앉았다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "Dream_Cord_Choice">>
<</page>>

:: Dream_Cord_Choice {"position":"2550,825","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="choice-screen">
<div class="choice-prompt">무언가가 발목을 잡고 있다.</div>

<div class="global-choice-layer">
<div class="global-choice-box">
<<choiceTo "풀어낸다" "Dream_Cord_Untie">>
<<choiceTo "끊어낸다" "Dream_Cord_Cut">>
<<choiceTo "가만히 있는다" "Dream_Cord_Still">>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<</page>>

:: Dream_Cord_Untie {"position":"2675,775","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">늑대는 매듭을 더듬었다.

어디선가 들었던 목소리가,
손끝을 아주 잠깐 멈춰 세웠다.

서두르지 마라.</div>
</div>

<<stateNotice "bond">>
<<recordNotice "dream">>

<<continueTo "AdvanceDay">>
<</page>>

:: Dream_Cord_Cut {"position":"2675,825","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $shura = ($shura || 0) + 1>>
<<clampStats>>

<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">늑대는 끊어냈다.

끈이었는지,
손이었는지,
끝내 확인하지 않았다.</div>
</div>

<<stateNotice "shura">>
<<recordNotice "dream">>

<<continueTo "AdvanceDay">>
<</page>>

:: Dream_Cord_Still {"position":"2675,875","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $isolation = ($isolation || 0) + 1>>
<<clampStats>>

<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">가만히 있었다.

가만히 있는 것은,
명령을 기다리는 것과 닮아 있었다.</div>
</div>

<<stateNotice "isolation">>
<<recordNotice "dream">>

<<continueTo "AdvanceDay">>
<</page>>

:: Dream_NoName {"position":"2425,950","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $dreamNoNameSeen = true>>
<<set $traceFirstDream = true>>
<<set $recordBookNewDream = true>>
<<set $lastDream = "no_name">>

<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">누군가가 늑대를 불렀다.

하지만 그 이름은
늑대의 것이 아니었다.

다른 이름이었다.

오래전에 버렸거나,
한 번도 가진 적 없는 이름이었다.

늑대는 돌아보지 않았다.

그런데도 몸은 대답했다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "Dream_NoName_Choice">>
<</page>>

:: Dream_NoName_Choice {"position":"2550,950","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
